---
title: How the phone knows the Mac is nearby and busy
board: 1500x900
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Mac as Helm on the Mac
  participant Srv as Helm server (on the Mac)
  participant Ph as Helm Mobile
  Srv-->>Ph: Bonjour _helm._tcp on the Wi-Fi, TXT has environmentId
  Note over Ph: NWBrowser sees the paired Mac = nearby. Other network: no pill
  Mac->>Srv: reportClientActivity · focused + open thread scope
  Srv-->>Ph: subscribeBackgroundPolicy · which thread, focused, last input
  Note over Ph: pill shows: nearby AND Mac used in the last 2 min
  Ph->>Srv: hold mic, let go · voice.transcribe
  Ph->>Srv: message.dispatch (steer or queue) · sent by default
  Ph->>Srv: or "Type on the Mac" · composer.insert
  Srv-->>Mac: text appears in the composer
  Srv-->>Ph: run finished or needs you · short haptic while the pill is up
  Ph->>Srv: "Open on Mac" · desktop.openThread
  Srv-->>Mac: the thread opens and the window comes forward
